nd thronged about him.", "tokens": [50388, 400, 415, 1437, 365, 796, 11, 293, 257, 869, 6919, 6263, 796, 293, 739, 556, 292, 466, 796, 13, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 49, "seek": 18000, "start": 187.04, "end": 192.04, "text": " And there was a woman who had had a discharge of blood for twelve years, and who had suffered", "tokens": [50717, 400, 456, 390, 257, 3059, 567, 632, 632, 257, 21718, 295, 3390, 337, 14390, 924, 11, 293, 567, 632, 12770, 50967], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 50, "seek": 18000, "start": 192.04, "end": 197.66, "text": " much under many physicians, and had spent all that she had and was no better, but rather", "tokens": [50967, 709, 833, 867, 21966, 11, 293, 632, 4418, 439, 300, 750, 632, 293, 390, 572, 1101, 11, 457, 2831, 51248], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 51, "seek": 18000, "start": 197.66, "end": 198.4, "text": " grew worse.", "tokens": [51248, 6109, 5324, 13, 51285], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 52, "seek": 18000, "start": 199.4, "end": 203.6, "text": " She had heard the reports about Jesus and came up behind him in the crowd and touched", "tokens": [51335, 1240, 632, 2198, 264, 7122, 466, 2705, 293, 1361, 493, 2261, 796, 294, 264, 6919, 293, 9828, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 53, "seek": 18000, "start": 203.6, "end": 205.44, "text": " his garment, for she said,", "tokens": [51545, 702, 35084, 11, 337, 750, 848, 11, 51637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 54, "seek": 18000, "start": 206.26, "end": 209.98, "text": " If I touch even his garments, I will be made well.", "tokens": [51678, 759, 286, 2557, 754, 702, 44881, 11, 286, 486, 312, 1027, 731, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16248157568145216, "compression_ratio": 1.69921875, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005614662659354508}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20998, "start": 209.98, "end": 217.7, "text": " And immediately the flow of blood dried up, and she felt in her body that she was healed", "tokens": [50365, 400, 4258, 264, 3095, 295, 3390, 13538, 493, 11, 293, 750, 2762, 294, 720, 1772, 300, 750, 390, 20482, 50751], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20998, "start": 217.7, "end": 218.62, "text": " of her disease.", "tokens": [50751, 295, 720, 4752, 13, 50797], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20998, "start": 219.35999999999999, "end": 224.06, "text": " And Jesus, perceiving in himself that power had gone out from him, immediately turned", "tokens": [50834, 400, 2705, 11, 9016, 2123, 294, 3647, 300, 1347, 632, 2780, 484, 490, 796, 11, 4258, 3574, 51069], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20998, "start": 224.06, "end": 225.48, "text": " about in the crowd and said,", "tokens": [51069, 466, 294, 264, 6919, 293, 848, 11, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20998, "start": 226.12, "end": 227.7, "text": " Who touched my garments?", "tokens": [51172, 2102, 9828, 452, 44881, 30, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20998, "start": 228.62, "end": 230.23999999999998, "text": " And his disciples said to him,", "tokens": [51297, 400, 702, 17209, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20998, "start": 230.95999999999998, "end": 236.26, "text": " You see the crowd pressing around you, and yet you say, Who touched me?", "tokens": [51414, 509, 536, 264, 6919, 12417, 926, 291, 11, 293, 1939, 291, 584, 11, 2102, 9828, 385, 30, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20998, "start": 236.56, "end": 239.23999999999998, "text": " And he looked around to see who had done it.", "tokens": [51694, 400, 415, 2956, 926, 281, 536, 567, 632, 1096, 309, 13, 51828], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1599568139939081, "compression_ratio": 1.7117903930131004, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014778826152905822}, {"id": 63, "seek": 23924, "start": 239.24, "end": 244.4, "text": " But the woman, knowing what had happened to her, came in fear and trembling and fell", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 3059, 11, 5276, 437, 632, 2011, 281, 720, 11, 1361, 294, 4240, 293, 47354, 293, 5696, 50623], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23924, "start": 244.4, "end": 247.06, "text": " down before him and told him the whole truth.", "tokens": [50623, 760, 949, 796, 293, 1907, 796, 264, 1379, 3494, 13, 50756], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23924, "start": 247.44, "end": 248.44, "text": " And he said to her,", "tokens": [50775, 400, 415, 848, 281, 720, 11, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23924, "start": 249.04000000000002, "end": 252.04000000000002, "text": " Daughter, your faith has made you well.", "tokens": [50855, 3933, 2395, 11, 428, 4522, 575, 1027, 291, 731, 13, 51005], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23924, "start": 252.46, "end": 255.34, "text": " Go in peace and be healed of your disease.", "tokens": [51026, 1037, 294, 4336, 293, 312, 20482, 295, 428, 4752, 13, 51170], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23924, "start": 256.08, "end": 259.98, "text": " While he was still speaking, there came from the ruler's house some who said,", "tokens": [51207, 3987, 415, 390, 920, 4124, 11, 456, 1361, 490, 264, 19661, 311, 1782, 512, 567, 848, 11, 51402], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23924, "start": 260.68, "end": 262.14, "text": " Your daughter is dead.", "tokens": [51437, 2260, 4653, 307, 3116, 13, 51510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23924, "start": 262.8, "end": 264.56, "text": " Why trouble the teacher any further?", "tokens": [51543, 1545, 5253, 264, 5027, 604, 3052, 30, 51631], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23924, "start": 265.08, "end": 269.12, "text": " But overhearing what they said, Jesus said to the ruler of the synagogue,", "tokens": [51657, 583, 29807, 1921, 437, 436, 848, 11, 2705, 848, 281, 264, 19661, 295, 264, 49169, 11, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283144142668126, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009697033674456179}, {"id": 72, "seek": 26924, "start": 269.24, "end": 272.76, "text": " Do not fear, only believe.", "tokens": [50365, 1144, 406, 4240, 11, 787, 1697, 13, 50541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 73, "seek": 26924, "start": 273.56, "end": 278.2, "text": " And he allowed no one to follow him except Peter and James, and John the brother of James.", "tokens": [50581, 400, 415, 4350, 572, 472, 281, 1524, 796, 3993, 6508, 293, 5678, 11, 293, 2619, 264, 3708, 295, 5678, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 74, "seek": 26924, "start": 278.64, "end": 284.08, "text": " They came to the house of the ruler of the synagogue, and Jesus saw a commotion, people", "tokens": [50835, 814, 1361, 281, 264, 1782, 295, 264, 19661, 295, 264, 49169, 11, 293, 2705, 1866, 257, 800, 19228, 11, 561, 51107], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26924, "start": 284.08, "end": 285.84000000000003, "text": " weeping and wailing loudly.", "tokens": [51107, 321, 10921, 293, 261, 23315, 22958, 13, 51195], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26924, "start": 286.38, "end": 288.38, "text": " And when he had entered, he said to them,", "tokens": [51222, 400, 562, 415, 632, 9065, 11, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26924, "start": 288.94, "end": 292.04, "text": " Why are you making a commotion and weeping?", "tokens": [51350, 1545, 366, 291, 1455, 257, 800, 19228, 293, 321, 10921, 30, 51505], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 78, "seek": 26924, "start": 292.36, "end": 294.86, "text": " The child is not dead, but sleeping.", "tokens": [51521, 440, 1440, 307, 406, 3116, 11, 457, 8296, 13, 51646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 79, "seek": 26924, "start": 294.86, "end": 297.04, "text": " And they laughed at him.", "tokens": [51646, 400, 436, 20881, 412, 796, 13, 51755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26924, "start": 297.44, "end": 299.22, "text": " But he put them all outside.", "tokens": [51775, 583, 415, 829, 552, 439, 2380, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1888144077398838, "compression_ratio": 1.6599190283400809, "no_speech_prob": 0.003429110161960125}, {"id": 81, "seek": 29924, "start": 299.24, "end": 304.74, "text": " And took the child's father and mother, and those who were with him, and went in where the child was.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 1890, 264, 1440, 311, 3086, 293, 2895, 11, 293, 729, 567, 645, 365, 796, 11, 293, 1437, 294, 689, 264, 1440, 390, 13, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 82, "seek": 29924, "start": 304.74, "end": 307.24, "text": " Taking her by the hand, he said to her,", "tokens": [50640, 17837, 720, 538, 264, 1011, 11, 415, 848, 281, 720, 11, 50765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 83, "seek": 29924, "start": 307.74, "end": 309.74, "text": " Talitha, koumi.", "tokens": [50790, 10516, 355, 64, 11, 350, 263, 3057, 13, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 84, "seek": 29924, "start": 309.74, "end": 311.74, "text": " Which means,", "tokens": [50890, 3013, 1355, 11, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 85, "seek": 29924, "start": 311.74, "end": 315.74, "text": " Little girl, I say to you, arise.", "tokens": [50990, 8022, 2013, 11, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 20288, 13, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 86, "seek": 29924, "start": 315.74, "end": 320.74, "text": " And immediately the girl got up and began walking, for she was twelve years of age,", "tokens": [51190, 400, 4258, 264, 2013, 658, 493, 293, 4283, 4494, 11, 337, 750, 390, 14390, 924, 295, 3205, 11, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29924, "start": 320.74, "end": 323.74, "text": " and they were immediately overcome with amazement.", "tokens": [51440, 293, 436, 645, 4258, 10473, 365, 669, 921, 1712, 13, 51590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29924, "start": 323.74, "end": 327.24, "text": " And he strictly charged them that no one should know this,", "tokens": [51590, 400, 415, 20792, 11109, 552, 300, 572, 472, 820, 458, 341, 11, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29924, "start": 327.24, "end": 329.24, "text": " and told them to give her something to eat.", "tokens": [51765, 293, 1907, 552, 281, 976, 720, 746, 281, 1862, 13, 51865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3001950073242188, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 0.007684797048568726}, {"id": 90, "seek": 32924, "start": 329.74, "end": 331.24, "text": " But the themselves listened.", "tokens": [50390, 583, 264, 2969, 13207, 13, 50465], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.4417134203941995, "compression_ratio": 2.2252747252747254, "no_speech_prob": 0.020589489489793777}, {"id": 91, "seek": 32924, "start": 331.24, "end": 333.24, "text": " When Hobose added the conflicts of anger and dread,", "tokens": [50465, 1133, 22966, 541, 3869, 264, 19807, 295, 10240, 293, 22236, 11, 50565], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.4417134203941995, "compression_ratio": 2.2252747252747254, "no_speech_prob": 0.020589489489793777}, {"id": 92, "seek": 32924, "start": 333.24, "end": 335.24, "text": " then Abram and Abraha appeared and said,", "tokens": [50565, 550, 31717, 335, 293, 2847, 424, 1641, 8516, 293, 848, 11, 50665], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.4417134203941995, "compression_ratio": 2.2252747252747254, "no_speech_prob": 0.020589489489793777}, {"id": 93, "seek": 32924, "start": 335.24, "end": 337.24, "text": " Behold, we are begotten children!", "tokens": [50665, 879, 4104, 11, 321, 366, 4612, 310, 1147, 2227, 0, 50765], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.4417134203941995, "compression_ratio": 2.2252747252747254, "no_speech_prob": 0.020589489489793777}, {"id": 94, "seek": 32924, "start": 337.24, "end": 341.74, "text": " Behold, know thy native God!", "tokens": [50765, 879, 4104, 11, 458, 15196, 8470, 1265, 0, 50990], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.4417134203941995, "compression_ratio": 2.2252747252747254, "no_